      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03670",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "真痛心啊！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "How heartbreaking!\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03670",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "三公主置之不答，把身子俯伏下来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The Third Princess gave no answer and bowed herself down.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03670",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "源氏以为这不答也难怪，不再穷诘。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Genji thought it was no wonder she did not answer, and pressed her no further.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03670",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "他推测：“她此时不知作何感想。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He wondered, \"What can she be feeling at this moment?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03670",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "虽然不是富有情感的人，但总不能漠然无动于衷吧。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even if she is not a deeply emotional person, surely she cannot be entirely unmoved.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03670",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "便觉此人十分可怜。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "At that, he felt deeply sorry for her.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
